    "value": "Two branches at one point of S cut disjoint families of traces."
  },
  {
    "field": "argument_node.pretty",
    "value": "∀ {X : Type u_1} {Y : Type u_2} {𝒞 : Set (X → Y)} {S : Set X} {x : X} {u v : Y},\n  x ∈ S → u ≠ v → Disjoint (S.restrict '' {d | d ∈ 𝒞 ∧ d x = u}) (S.restrict '' {d | d ∈ 𝒞 ∧ d x = v})"
  },
  {
