  },
  {
    "field": "argument_node.pretty",
    "value": "∀ {X : Type u_1} {Y : Type u_2} {𝒞 : Set (X → Y)} {S : Set X} {P : X → Set Y} {x : X} {u v : Y},\n  x ∈ S →\n    P ∈ pairCubes {c | c ∈ 𝒞 ∧ c x = u} S →\n      P ∈ pairCubes {c | c ∈ 𝒞 ∧ c x = v} S → graft P x (pairOf✝ u v) ∈ pairCubes 𝒞 S"
